  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed development, by virtue of its excessive size, scale and inappropriate position, would result in an increased sense of enclosure, and a loss of light and outlook that would harm the living conditions of neighbouring properties. The proposed development would therefore be contrary to Local Plan Policies CC2 (Urban Design and Architecture) and SC7 (Residential Extensions and Alterations); the intent of the Residential Extension Guidelines.",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposed development, by virtue of its excessive size, scale and inappropriate position, would fail to reflect the portions of the original property and appear appropriately subservient and subordinate to the host property. The proposed extension would result in a bulky and incongruous addition to the host property which would harm the character and appearance of the site and surrounding area. The proposal is therefore contrary to Local Plan Policies CC1 (Context and Character), CC2 (Urban Design and Architecture) and SC7 (Residential Extensions and Alterations; the intent of the Residential Extension Guidelines."
